---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Research Library｜J 的世界 Research">

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">

    <div class="kicker">RESEARCH · LIBRARY</div>

    <h1>Research Library</h1>

    <p>
      以研究事件為起點，建立技術、供應鏈與證據之間的長期研究資料庫。
      從單一 Research Edition，逐步延伸至產業地圖、研究海報與 First Printing。
    </p>

  </div>
</section>


<section class="section">

  <div class="section-head">

    <div>
      <div class="kicker">CURRENT EDITION</div>
      <h2>Research Vol.01</h2>
    </div>

    <p>AI Platform Evolution</p>

  </div>


  <article class="edition-card">

    <div class="edition-main">

      <span class="tag">VOL.01 · FIRST EDITION</span>

      <h3>AI Platform Evolution</h3>

      <p class="lead">
        從台積電 2026 China Technology Symposium 出發，
        拆解 AI Platform 從先進製程、先進封裝、
        光互連、材料、設備到 AI Infrastructure 的演進。
      </p>

      <div class="edition-meta">

        <span>P1–P8</span>
        <span>Facts First</span>
        <span>Evidence-Based Research</span>
        <span>2026</span>

      </div>

    </div>


    <div class="edition-actions">

      <a class="button" href="/research/vol01">
        Explore Vol.01 →
      </a>

      <a class="button-secondary" href="/maps">
        Industry Maps
      </a>

      <a class="button-secondary" href="/posters">
        Posters
      </a>

      <a
        class="button-secondary"
        href="/downloads/J的世界_Research_Vol01_First_Printing.pdf"
        target="_blank"
      >
        First Printing PDF
      </a>

    </div>

  </article>

</section>


<section class="feature">

  <div class="section">

    <div class="section-head">

      <div>
        <div class="kicker">VOL.01 · CONTENT MAP</div>
        <h2>研究架構</h2>
      </div>

      <p>Story → Evidence → Technology → Future Watch</p>

    </div>


    <div class="grid">

      <article class="card">

        <span class="tag">P1 · STORY</span>

        <h3>從一場技術論壇開始</h3>

        <p>
          建立研究事件背景，
          理解為什麼這場技術論壇值得成為 AI Platform
          研究的起點。
        </p>

        <span class="page-status">
          Reading page coming next
        </span>

      </article>


      <article class="card">

        <span class="tag">P2 · EVIDENCE</span>

        <h3>先把事實與推論分開</h3>

        <p>
          將公開資訊、官方資料與產業推論分層，
          建立後續研究的 Evidence Framework。
        </p>

        <span class="page-status">
          Reading page coming next
        </span>

      </article>


      <article class="card">

        <span class="tag">P3 · AI PLATFORM</span>

        <h3>四個訊號</h3>

        <p>
          Compute Scaling、Advanced Packaging、
          Optical Interconnect 與 Materials & Infrastructure。
        </p>

        <span class="page-status">
          Reading page coming next
        </span>

      </article>


      <article class="card">

        <span class="tag">P4 · TECHNOLOGY</span>

        <h3>從晶片走向系統</h3>

        <p>
          建立 AI Compute → Process → Packaging →
          Optical → Thermal / Power → System 的技術路徑。
        </p>

        <span class="page-status">
          Reading page coming next
        </span>

      </article>


      <article class="card">

        <span class="tag">P5 · GLASS CORE</span>

        <h3>Glass Core：結果，而不是起點</h3>

        <p>
          從 Glass、TGV、Core Substrate 到 Advanced Packaging，
          觀察 Glass Core 在 AI 平台中的位置。
        </p>

        <span class="page-status">
          Reading page coming next
        </span>

      </article>


      <article class="card">

        <span class="tag">P6 · INVESTMENT MATRIX</span>

        <h3>技術節點 × 產業觀察</h3>

        <p>
          將技術路徑轉換成 Process、Packaging、
          Optical、Materials、Infrastructure 與 System。
        </p>

        <span class="page-status">
          Reading page coming next
        </span>

      </article>


      <article class="card">

        <span class="tag">P7 · FUTURE WATCH</span>

        <h3>下一個真正值得驗證的訊號</h3>

        <p>
          從驗證、導入、量產到擴散，
          建立長期追蹤 AI 技術落地的觀察框架。
        </p>

        <span class="page-status">
          Reading page coming next
        </span>

      </article>


      <article class="card">

        <span class="tag">P8 · METHODOLOGY</span>

        <h3>Reference & Methodology</h3>

        <p>
          Facts First、Evidence-Based Research、
          J Insight 與研究資料來源。
        </p>

        <span class="page-status">
          Reading page coming next
        </span>

      </article>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="section">

  <div class="section-head">

    <div>
      <div class="kicker">RESEARCH ECOSYSTEM</div>
      <h2>同一份研究，四種閱讀方式</h2>
    </div>

  </div>


  <div class="grid">

    <article class="card ecosystem-card">

      <span class="tag">01 · RESEARCH</span>

      <h3>完整研究</h3>

      <p>
        以 P1–P8 的連續閱讀方式，
        理解完整研究邏輯與技術路徑。
      </p>

      <a class="button-secondary" href="/research/vol01">
        Open Research →
      </a>

    </article>


    <article class="card ecosystem-card">

      <span class="tag">02 · INDUSTRY MAPS</span>

      <h3>產業地圖</h3>

      <p>
        將研究中的技術節點轉換成
        AI、Glass Core 與 CPO 產業鏈。
      </p>

      <a class="button-secondary" href="/maps">
        Explore Maps →
      </a>

    </article>


    <article class="card ecosystem-card">

      <span class="tag">03 · POSTERS</span>

      <h3>研究海報</h3>

      <p>
        將複雜研究濃縮成一頁式視覺化內容，
        適合快速閱讀與分享。
      </p>

      <a class="button-secondary" href="/posters">
        Explore Posters →
      </a>

    </article>


    <article class="card ecosystem-card">

      <span class="tag">04 · FIRST PRINTING</span>

      <h3>印刷級 PDF</h3>

      <p>
        Research Vol.01 First Printing，
        作為完整研究的正式出版版本。
      </p>

      <a
        class="button-secondary"
        href="/downloads/J的世界_Research_Vol01_First_Printing.pdf"
        target="_blank"
      >
        Open PDF →
      </a>

    </article>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="cta">

  <div class="cta-inner">

    <div>

      <div class="kicker">NEXT · V1.2-04B</div>

      <h2>從研究目錄，進入每一頁。</h2>

      <p>
        下一階段將把 P1–P8 建立成八個獨立閱讀頁，
        讓 Research Vol.01 真正成為可長期閱讀與引用的研究內容。
      </p>

    </div>

    <a class="button" href="/research/vol01">
      Open Vol.01 →
    </a>

  </div>

</section>


<style>

  .edition-card {
    border: 1px solid #344457;
    background:
      linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        rgba(28, 42, 58, .96),
        rgba(14, 21, 30, .98)
      );
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 38px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 44px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .edition-main h3 {
    font-size: 34px;
    margin: 12px 0;
  }

  .lead {
    color: #b7c3d0;
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .edition-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 22px;
  }

  .edition-meta span {
    border: 1px solid #354457;
    border-radius: 7px;
    padding: 5px 9px;
    color: #b9c6d4;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .edition-actions {
    min-width: 190px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .edition-actions .button,
  .edition-actions .button-secondary {
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .page-status {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 16px;
    color: #718093;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: .06em;
  }

  .ecosystem-card {
    min-height: 100%;
  }

  .ecosystem-card .button-secondary {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  @media(max-width:800px) {

    .edition-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 26px;
      gap: 26px;
    }

    .edition-main h3 {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .edition-actions {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .edition-actions .button,
    .edition-actions .button-secondary {
      text-align: center;
    }

  }

</style>

</BaseLayout>
